      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 18,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "The fruits which your soul lusted after have been lost to you. All things that were dainty and sumptuous have perished from you, and you will find them no more at all.",
      "ko": "바벨론아 네 영혼의 탐하던 과실이 네게서 떠났으며 맛 있는 것들과 빛난 것들이 다 없어졌으니 사람들이 결코 이것들을 다시 보지 못하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "e084ade886c4b01ea050d6229b61af52d04dd7ce67794aaf9c1c0ba5ba2d1fc4",
      "translation_text_hash": "b45a038d60cd59569016d98d60a63806363d50c73a15b8f77dd5195b55a3898a",
